OL,3,GNEWSAHow many sewage spills have
OL,4,Ahappened in your part of Scotland?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 76,000 sewage spills were
OL,7,Frecorded after new monitoring equipment
OL,8,Fwas installed at waste overflow sites
OL,9,Fin Scotland, BBC analysis suggests.
OL,11,FThe addition of 1,009 sewer monitors in
OL,12,F2024 increased the proportion of the
OL,13,FScottish Water network being monitored
OL,14,Ffrom 6% to 30%.
OL,16,FNow the latest figures have revealed
OL,17,Ftens of thousands of spills which would
OL,18,Fpreviously have been unrecorded,
OL,19,Fincluding hundreds at beauty spots like
OL,20,FLoch Lomond.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
