OL,3,GNEWSAHow many sewage spills have
OL,4,Ahappened in your part of Scotland?
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish Water said the vast majority
OL,7,Fof the spills were not harmful to the
OL,8,Fenvironment, and that increased
OL,9,Fmonitoring had improved understanding
OL,10,Fof the sewer network.
